SUMMARY:US jobs report (January)
DESCRIPTION:January nonfarm payrolls\, the first labour print after the Jan
 uary 27 FOMC.\n\nThe BLS February 2027 schedule lists February 5 at 8:30am
  ET. A strong print is bearish for crypto and tech while the Fed is hiking
 . A weak one supports risk assets and gold.\n\nBLS: February 2027 release 
 schedule: https://www.bls.gov/schedule/2027/02_sched_list.htm
