DESCRIPTION:January consumer prices from the BLS.\n\nThe BLS February 2027 
 schedule lists February 11 at 8:30am ET. One third-party calendar shows Fe
 bruary 10 and marks it unconfirmed\, so the BLS date stands. A hot print l
 ifts yields and the dollar and hurts crypto\, tech and gold.\n\nBLS: Febru
 ary 2027 release schedule: https://www.bls.gov/schedule/2027/02_sched_list
 .htm
